{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_007ior_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_007ior_title", "source_sha256": "9a8f919bf976c4e30d63dc33e3b24b7baecb3a33594c9b2b4e9ec51a265745cb", "ja": "私はKAWAII！", "zh": "我很KAWAII！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_007ior_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_007ior_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d6b58a7f15074250188597cc560b05eb421fb355e9877fc4352be926a42d405a", "ja": "合同イベントの衣装合わせ中。装飾が\nいっぱいの衣装に腰が引ける春香と琴葉に\n伊織の特訓がはじまる。バッチリ効果が\n表れる春香。一方、演技で誤魔化していた\n琴葉に、伊織の真っすぐな言葉が響く。", "zh": "联合活动试装中。面对装饰\n繁复的服装，春香与琴叶有些退缩，\n伊织便对她们展开了特训。春香身上\n立竿见影。而面对用演技敷衍过去的\n琴叶，伊织直率的话语触动了她的心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_007ior_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_007ior_1000_null", "source_sha256": "5592bb96991fc8e3496deaaae2275eff1e9cdf3a91977d5905795681db7567ef", "ja": "―合同イベント　衣装合わせ―", "zh": "——联合活动　试衣——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_007ior_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_007ior_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "9147665a746de6ba95f05aceb975ec4509b4d54fa6a9edbe45644728a3014bdf", "ja": "うわぁ……、お人形さんみたいな衣装だね！\nフリルとリボンのボリュームがすごいかも……！", "zh": "哇……这套服装就像洋娃娃一样！\n荷叶边和蝴蝶结的分量好足啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_007ior_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_007ior_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "9767b72dee03c2c408f9cff29778d84c3535f6ecce7e1f85385e12304cef1d29", "ja": "こういう衣装ってたまにあるけど……。\nえへへ、いまだにちょっと勇気が必要かな。", "zh": "这种风格的服装偶尔也会有……  \n嘿嘿，到现在穿起来还是需要一点勇气呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_007ior_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_007ior_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "4561c7627617072bb607aab22ef214a70c3395cfd8cdc64708cb401f31c609ea", "ja": "本当に似合っているのか、不安になるよね。\n春香ちゃんはすごく似合ってるけど……。", "zh": "总会担心这身衣服是不是真的适合自己呢。  \n春香穿起来真的很合适，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_007ior_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_007ior_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "ca7ec22a72c57b2cb609ccde08dac9e3e472a8ab28a15d7b0c819cc4190e6e66", "ja": "うう、ほんとに？って、心配になるよね。\n琴葉ちゃんは着こなせてるけど……。", "zh": "呜呜，会忍不住担心“真的很合适吗？”呢。\n琴叶穿得很合适，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_007ior_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_007ior_1005_007ior", "source_sha256": "68428eb0cca34a101c4b943b7ad083c29c27f1338ed5e7b5f3a14311de02e8a3", "ja": "アンタたち、まだそんなこと言ってるのね。\nそれでもアイドル？", "zh": "你们还在说这种话啊。\n这样也算偶像吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_007ior_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_007ior_1006_007ior", "source_sha256": "f3b4a52ab58feb200faa4836f288786aacf0c1fdf6416138140ada8771552c8f", "ja": "カワイイ衣装くらい着こなせなくてどうするのよ。\nこうなったら、私が特訓してあげるわ！", "zh": "连可爱的服装都驾驭不了，那还怎么行啊。\n既然这样，就由我来给你特训吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_007ior_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_007ior_1007_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_007ior_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_007ior_1008_007ior", "source_sha256": "52624867eb2f772f31153b8827a6aefc775046c96017c7c84a75e0a858193613", "ja": "はい。鏡の前に立って、とってもカワイイ春香ちゃん、\nとってもカワイイ春香ちゃんって10回唱えなさい！", "zh": "好。站到镜子前，反复念10遍：“超可爱的春香，超可爱的春香！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_007ior_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_007ior_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "9293d5131353163479029587cfd3693ca9b1fba2b31f68043500bd89ffc7500a", "ja": "ええ？　そんな恥ずかしい言葉を……。はっ！\nもしかして、伊織はこれを毎日やってるの？", "zh": "诶？这种让人害羞的话……啊！\n难道说，伊织每天都在做这个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_007ior_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_007ior_1010_007ior", "source_sha256": "a45f34b04e35d603c43cb11f3370d4464f945a1cae38d6a270a1c898b3fabd64", "ja": "やってないわよ！　アンタたちのために考えてあげた\n課題に決まってるでしょ。ほら、早くやりなさい！", "zh": "才没做过呢！这肯定是我特意为你们想出的\n课题呀。好啦，赶紧照着做！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_007ior_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_007ior_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "da5d76ddbe6c770cb883a57fd13077f2c9f62463d5682bb4d7532924ae814ada", "ja": "と、とってもカワイイ春香ちゃん、とってもカワイイ\n春香ちゃん、とってもカワイイ春香ちゃん……、", "zh": "超、超可爱的春香，超可爱的春香，超可爱的春香……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
