{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_007ior_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_007ior_1019_017kth", "source_sha256": "51852db593ccb27724e98bfbeff2f9bf46060aad7169ac068bc56a3af3700fae", "ja": "とってもカワイイ琴葉ちゃん、とってもカワイイ\n琴葉ちゃん、とってもカワイイ琴葉ちゃん……。", "zh": "超可爱的琴叶，超可爱\n琴叶，超可爱的琴叶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_007ior_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_007ior_1020_017kth", "source_sha256": "ed58710a7606d4ea6317e3cef67c4b0cb6572ce0f0083434dfa092e5efdc9b89", "ja": "……伊織ちゃん、わかったよ。\n私ってこんなに可愛かったんだね♪", "zh": "……伊织，我明白了。\n原来我是这么可爱啊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_007ior_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_007ior_1021_017kth", "source_sha256": "ff9f9a4b857d079c7c9aa0f5303ae147259021e697db15b929538d470f71a8c9", "ja": "はぁ……♪　つるつるのお肌に大きな瞳、\n世界で一番カワイイのは、この琴葉ちゃん♪", "zh": "哈啊……♪光滑的肌肤，大大的眼睛，世界上最可爱的就是这个琴叶♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_007ior_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_007ior_1022_007ior", "source_sha256": "a68b552d944a8fc82b1a7230a4762ac5826cf99311310b229c7ee79da967ed78", "ja": "なんか嘘っぽいわ……。\n琴葉、それってただの演技じゃない？", "zh": "总觉得有点像在说谎……琴叶，那只是演戏吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_007ior_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_007ior_1023_017kth", "source_sha256": "4cc55e3a01edd75368b8472e5b835563b9315295953c3ba6e57f0461f6adecd3", "ja": "う……わかる？", "zh": "唔……看得出来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_007ior_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_007ior_1024_007ior", "source_sha256": "c8dfb3e51ae0f435b433054772df31ab5740957f83e0f09fcc173c484f09c04d", "ja": "わかるわよ。伊織ちゃんを見くびらないでちょうだい。\nまぁ、それが琴葉のやり方かもしれないけど……。", "zh": "我当然知道。别小看伊织啊。\n不过，那或许就是琴叶的做法吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_007ior_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_007ior_1025_007ior", "source_sha256": "0d1a37f309898ddccb3f44f600fa9ecc90c2bdaab1a73104b6f512c3a40a7698", "ja": "わざわざ別人になる必要なんてあるのかしら。\n琴葉、すごくカワイイじゃない。", "zh": "有必要特意变成另一个人吗？\n琴叶不是很可爱嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_007ior_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_007ior_1026_007ior", "source_sha256": "93b94d9ba5630916d46bd42149491ae774c3b021f0dfbc73a678dc1118c45bc8", "ja": "周りだって認めてるんだから、\n少しは信じてあげてもいいんじゃないの？", "zh": "周围的人也都认可你，\n稍微相信一下大家又有什么不好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_007ior_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_007ior_1027_017kth", "source_sha256": "6e38367d2e2871655eb40f090cc2bf330896ebeb4a37d77ba8df878114f8c24a", "ja": "伊織ちゃん……ありがとう、頑張ってみる。ふふっ、\nなんだか{$P$}と話してるみたい。", "zh": "伊织……谢谢你，我会努力试试的。呵呵，\n总觉得像是在和{$P$}聊天一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_007ior_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_007ior_1028_007ior", "source_sha256": "8939f28281a1674111c61b69c5e22e1ff8f2848d57c9fd34ef57d7e09b341279", "ja": "や、やめてよ！　だいたい\n{$P$}なら、もっと上手に……。", "zh": "别、别这样啦！而且\n要是{$P$}的话，肯定会更擅长……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_007ior_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_007ior_1029_007ior", "source_sha256": "5b8ca24d586e23a1f7e978425afd3f758f3c01368c6153659a618f9db6016979", "ja": "ま、いいわ。\nとにかく……もう一度、鏡を見て。", "zh": "好、算了。\n总之……再照一次镜子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0416_story_007ior_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_007ior_1030_017kth", "source_sha256": "56a01a8df175a104c42fe4af934d57e851b1ba5e3b785026ae17028cb8cd0525", "ja": "あ……うん。", "zh": "啊……嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
